{"id":1749,"date":"2023-04-18T20:56:26","date_gmt":"2023-04-18T20:56:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/ridiculouslyhopeful.com\/?p=1749"},"modified":"2023-04-18T21:01:28","modified_gmt":"2023-04-18T21:01:28","slug":"its-donate-life-month","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/ridiculouslyhopeful.com\/its-donate-life-month\/","title":{"rendered":"It\u2019s Donate Life Month!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Observed in April each year,&nbsp;<strong>National Donate Life Month<\/strong>&nbsp;helps raise awareness about organ donation and to&nbsp;<em>honor those that have saved lives through the gift of donation.<\/em><br><br>With the publishing of&nbsp;<em>Ridiculously Hopeful,&nbsp;<\/em>we not only share the testimony of our son, Townes, but we also celebrate and long to honor and remember the legacy of our son&#8217;s donor and his\/her family.<br><br>A family whom we&nbsp;will likely never meet, while faced with the most unthinkable decision, selflessly chose to change the course of my family\u2019s future. Our donor family gave us the most precious gift; one we did not deserve,&nbsp;nor can we ever repay.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>We long for their child\u2019s legacy to extend far beyond our family to extend exponential hope to others. Would you join our campaign?<br>&nbsp;<br><em><strong>Will you become a Hope Donor?<\/strong><\/em><br>&nbsp;<br>To become a&nbsp;<em>Hope Donor<\/em>, we ask that you extend the gift of hope and encouragement to others by gifting a copy or two of&nbsp;<em>Ridiculously Hopeful<\/em>.&nbsp; You can even send a copy direct from&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/Ridiculously-Hopeful-Story-During-Crisis\/dp\/1664272364\/ref=cm_cr_arp_d_product_top?ie=UTF8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon<\/a>&nbsp;with a note.<br><br>Together let\u2019s make an eternal impact and donate hope to others.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>More than 100,000\u00a0people are waiting for a lifesaving transplant. Transplants rely on the generosity of organ, eye and tissue donors, and there are not enough donors to meet the need. You can help.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"http:\/\/www.donatelife.net\/\" target=\"_blank\">https:\/\/www.donatelife.net<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Observed in April each year,&nbsp;National Donate Life Month&nbsp;helps raise awareness about organ donation and to&nbsp;honor those that have saved lives through the gift of donation. With the publishing of&nbsp;Ridiculously Hopeful,&nbsp;we not only share the testimony of our son, Townes, but we also celebrate and long to honor and remember the legacy of our son&#8217;s donor [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":1750,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"off","_et_pb_old_content":"","_et_gb_content_width":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1749","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ridiculouslyhopeful.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1749","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ridiculouslyhopeful.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ridiculouslyhopeful.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ridiculouslyhopeful.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ridiculouslyhopeful.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1749"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/ridiculouslyhopeful.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1749\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1751,"href":"https:\/\/ridiculouslyhopeful.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1749\/revisions\/1751"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/rid